{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='color: rgb(15, 17, 21); font-family: quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \"Open Sans\", \"Helvetica Neue\", sans-serif;'>數以萬計的候鳥，近日在中國中部河南省桐柏縣的一處濕地及周邊湖泊棲息。白鷺、牛背鷺和夜鷺正在那裡繁殖和育雛，大部分雛鳥已經孵化。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"8487811_河南桐柏濕地 萬鳥棲息繁殖 - 截图3\" src=\"http://outin-63362ff8bc7011f09c8900163e08026a.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/a1a1499ce12748638b73af5db2ab86e2/snapshots/12b7b14e5b96449399d8338b69729a1e-00003.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"视频 8487811_河南桐柏濕地 萬鳥棲息繁殖 的第3张截图\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='color: rgb(15, 17, 21); font-family: quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \"Open Sans\", \"Helvetica Neue\", sans-serif;'>得益於近年來生態環境改善，該地區擁有豐富的水生資源，已成為鳥類築巢和覓食的理想棲息地。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"8487811_河南桐柏濕地 萬鳥棲息繁殖 - 截图7\" src=\"http://outin-63362ff8bc7011f09c8900163e08026a.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/a1a1499ce12748638b73af5db2ab86e2/snapshots/12b7b14e5b96449399d8338b69729a1e-00007.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"视频 8487811_河南桐柏濕地 萬鳥棲息繁殖 的第7张截图\"/><br/> </div><br/></div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-25T00:18:06.245401+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":107,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}